<title>UK: Spires Ltd sets 100 mln mark step-down bond.</title>
<headline>Spires Ltd sets 100 mln mark step-down bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following Ecuador investment bond was announced by lead manager Merrill Lynch.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SPIRES LTD, CAYMAN ISLANDS</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON   **14.5 PCT  MATURITY    10.MAR.15</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.0     PAY DATE   L27.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.5	 REOFFER    99.0	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> NOTES    **UNTIL MARCH 2000, THEN STEPS DOWN TO 10.375 PCT</p>
<p>		STANDARD CREDIT CALL PROVISIONS</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10	  LISTING    LUX/FFT   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC   2.0</p>
<p> NOTES	AMMORTISATION IN 10 EQUAL INSTALLMENTS FROM MAR.06</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
